Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:08:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] Add scheduled backup task with retention

New 'Create Backup' scheduled task (daily at 3:00 by default) that runs the
existing backup service and then deletes the oldest backups beyond the
configured retention count. Options (retention and backup content) live in
a new 'scheduledbackup' configuration store, editable via
/System/Configuration/scheduledbackup.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
